KOOFE MEIN DARD-O-GHAM KI AJAB CHHAGAYI FAZA,<br>
 DOOBA HUA HAIN KHOON MEIN SAB FARQE MURTAZA<br>
<br>
 KOOFE KE BEKASO THA DAR PAR EK ISDEHAAM,<br>
 BAITUL SHARAF THA BANGAYA MATAM SARA TAMAM,<br>
 SAB KO DILASA DETE THE SAR THAM KAR IMAM,<br>
 SAIDANIYO KE LAB PA THA BAS WA MUSIBATA<br>
<br>
PEHLU BADAL BADAL KE TADAPTE THE MURTUZA,<br>
 GEHRA HAI ZAKHM AB NA GIZA HAI NA HAI DAWA,<br>
 BABA KO DEKH DEKH KE ROTE HAIN MUJTABA,<br>
 SAR PEET KAR LAHAD MEIN TADAPTI HAIN FATIMA<br>
<br>
HASNAIN ROKE KEHTE THE BABA NA JAIYYE,<br>
 HUM GHAM ZADOON KO ITNA NA BABA RULAIYE,<br>
 JATE HO KIS PA CHOOD KE BABA BATAIYE,<br>
 KIS TARHA HOGA HUMSE YATEEMI KA SAMNA<br>
<br>
PHIR DIL KAR HUSSAIN KE RUQ PAR NAZAR IMAM,<br>
 BOLE TU ZIBHA HOYEGA KARBAL MEIN TASHNA KAAM,<br>
 ASHOOR KO LOOTE GA TERA GHAR GHAR TAMAM,<br>
 NAMOOS KE SARO SE BHI CHEEN JAYEGI RIDA<br>
